# UBS Data Pipeline

This is a simplified version of a real-world data pipeline used for financial data ingestion and analysis at scale.

📌 Technologies:
- PySpark & Spark SQL
- Apache Airflow
- AWS S3 / Glue
- Databricks (DBFS + Delta Lake)

📊 Features:
- Data ingestion from simulated trade feeds
- ETL with Spark jobs
- Workflow orchestration using Airflow DAGs
- Data quality checks
